{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "nav",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# 能力镜头覆盖、凭证与解绑恢复｜流程子图\nHero 拥有模式仲裁；CameraComponent 拥有 Offset 单槽；GA 保存原接收者／精确凭证。\n[[GGYGO_结构_相机.canvas|结构图]] · [[GGYGO_流程_相机.canvas|求值与发布主流程]]。\n原资源清理按 [[Input/结构#Hero本地ASC身份订阅与原H清理|Input 精确合同]] 消费 typed H。",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 1710,
			"height": 190,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "default",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "1. PawnData提供正常DefaultCameraMode配置。\nHeroComponent::DetermineCameraMode在覆盖列表为空时\n选择该默认类；不替缺失/非法配置生成另一镜头。\n有效类交给Prepare中的Push/Evaluate Result链。\n无效类明确失败，Manager停止受控发布。",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 392,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 280,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "2. GA A申请SetCameraMode(Class)。\n向原Hero登记SpecHandle_A，成功取得Generation_A。\nGA保存原Hero/Spec/generation；A成为有效请求。\n无效申请不伪造成功或换源。\n默认Cleanup从原Termination记录读取精确凭证，\n不按当前Avatar重新找接收者或重放。",
			"x": 470,
			"y": 392,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "3. GA B向同一原Hero申请合法模式，\n成功取得自己的SpecHandle_B + Generation_B。\nB置顶覆盖A；A的请求仍保留。\nB独立保存原接收者与精确凭证。\n原清理只归还该终止记录持有的资源，\n不影响数值相同但来源不同的后继。",
			"x": 970,
			"y": 392,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "bend",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "4A. 原 B 记录调用默认终止清理。\nClearAbilityCameraMode(Spec_B,Generation_B)\n只向原 Hero 撤回匹配条目；A 仍有效时重新选 A。\n迟到／无效／不匹配凭证返回 false，不清后继。",
			"x": 1470,
			"y": 243,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "aend",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "4B. 原 A 记录先进入默认终止清理。\n只清 Spec_A＋Generation_A，B 不受影响。\nCleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination(Context)\n核对原终止来源；先脱开仍匹配成员，\n再向原接收者归还精确资源。\n派生能力负责归还自己持有的资源。",
			"x": 1470,
			"y": 743,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "restore",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "5. 所有有效覆盖撤回后，Hero选PawnData默认类。\n后续Prepare：UpdateCameraModes →\nPushCameraMode / EvaluateStack返回真实Result。\n合法配置成功后才生成候选并进入原生发布门禁。\n委托未绑定/默认类非法明确失败，不继续旧栈。\nManager已Stopped时不因请求清空或Ready自动恢复；\n[[Camera/结构#发布准入与显式重启|原失败身份显式Restart]]。",
			"x": 970,
			"y": 1200,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "replace",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "同一 Spec 显式替换：先精确归还旧 Generation，再登记并取得更大的新 Generation。\n\n若旧清理稍后再次到达，它不能移除后继请求；generation 到上限后拒绝新请求，不回绕复用。",
			"x": 470,
			"y": 760,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 250,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "unbind",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "PawnExtension本地ASC身份订阅 / typed Notice。\nHero的PrepareLocalAbilitySystemSubscription\n先持原订阅记录，再注册原Extension并接受同步回放。\nReady / Refreshed / Released携带原身份合同。\n宿主/共享ASC解绑仍由Extension负责；\nHero不能把旧无参数广播作为当前清理来源。\n[[Input/结构#Hero本地ASC身份订阅与原H清理|原订阅与H合同]]。",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1070,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 290,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "hero-guard",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "ConsumeLocalAbilitySystemNotice(ExpectedSubscription, Notice)\n核对原订阅、typed H及真实上下文。\nReady关联已有输入/原retry；同H Refreshed不重绑。\nReleased只匹配原H，可接受其弱身份已经失效。\n先撤回原记录/派生关联，仅退休原H所属资源；\n无Controller/InputComponent不阻止原镜头撤回。\n新H、新输入/retry或新镜头请求受后继保护，\n旧清理不能继续写入替代来源。\n[[Input/结构#Hero本地ASC身份订阅与原H清理|精确条件]]。",
			"x": 470,
			"y": 1070,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "release-reset",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "原资源清理与镜头撤回。\n只释放确属原 H 的输入／retry；汇合后复核原记录、镜头代次与后继保护。\n清原 overrides，只 Reset 捕获的原 Camera。\nResetCameraRuntimeState → ClearStack → ThirdPerson.OnDeactivation，清侧移／弱来源键。\ngeneration／token 保持，不重放旧请求。\nEndPlay 按自身原生命周期归还资源。",
			"x": 470,
			"y": 1430,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "endplay",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Hero EndPlay：先bEndingPlay=true，\n停止旧初始化尾部，解绑DetermineCameraModeDelegate。\n按原订阅/资源记录释放自身资源并撤回原镜头；\n不调用旧无参数Handler或收养替代H。\n随后UnregisterInitStateFeature / Super。\n[[Camera/结构#解绑协调与后继保护|自身清理边界]]。",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1430,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 290,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "evidence",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "恢复请求与后续求值\nClearAbilityCameraMode／ResetCameraRuntimeState 只归还原资源。\nManager 为 Running：后续 UpdateCamera 经 Prepare 重新选类。\nManager 为 Stopped：资源撤回、配置修好或重复 Ready 都不自动重启；\nUpdateCamera 和 UpdateCameraPhotographyOnly 均保持原生 Cache。\n只有 RestartCameraEvaluation 接受精确原失败源并尝试一次；失败仍停止。\n[[Camera/结构#发布准入与显式重启|原身份 Restart]]。",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1735,
			"width": 890,
			"height": 270,
			"color": "6"
		}
	],
	"edges": [
		{
			"id": "e1",
			"fromNode": "default",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "a",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "合法模式申请 → 原Hero登记"
		},
		{
			"id": "e2",
			"fromNode": "a",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "b",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "后来的 Spec + generation 覆盖置顶"
		},
		{
			"id": "e3",
			"fromNode": "b",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "bend",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "原B终止记录 → 精确凭证清理（条件路径）"
		},
		{
			"id": "e4",
			"fromNode": "b",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "aend",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "原A终止记录 → 精确凭证清理（条件路径）"
		},
		{
			"id": "e5",
			"fromNode": "bend",
			"fromSide": "bottom",
			"toNode": "restore",
			"toSide": "top",
			"label": "A也撤回且有效覆盖清空"
		},
		{
			"id": "e6",
			"fromNode": "aend",
			"fromSide": "bottom",
			"toNode": "restore",
			"toSide": "right",
			"label": "B也撤回且有效覆盖清空"
		},
		{
			"id": "e7",
			"fromNode": "a",
			"fromSide": "bottom",
			"toNode": "replace",
			"toSide": "top",
			"label": "同 Spec 再登记"
		},
		{
			"id": "e8",
			"fromNode": "replace",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "restore",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "仅当前 generation 可清"
		},
		{
			"id": "e9",
			"fromNode": "default",
			"fromSide": "bottom",
			"toNode": "unbind",
			"toSide": "top",
			"label": "原Extension / ASC生命周期 → typed Notice"
		},
		{
			"id": "e10",
			"fromNode": "release-reset",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "restore",
			"toSide": "bottom",
			"label": "委托仍绑定且Manager Running：后续Prepare重新选类"
		},
		{
			"id": "e11",
			"fromNode": "unbind",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "hero-guard",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "原订阅的typed Ready / Refreshed / Released"
		},
		{
			"id": "e12",
			"fromNode": "hero-guard",
			"fromSide": "bottom",
			"toNode": "release-reset",
			"toSide": "top",
			"label": "匹配原H Released → 退休原资源并复核后继"
		},
		{
			"id": "e13",
			"fromNode": "endplay",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "release-reset",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "EndPlay按自身原生命周期释放资源"
		}
	]
}
